{"title": null, "datetime": "2019-04-01 16:00:00", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/Meeting.aspx?Id=43bb6049-5dac-4fc6-9e5d-ea3418d9485f&Agenda=PostMinutes&lang=English", "meeting_type": "Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee", "bills": null, "present": ["E. Holder", "M. van Holst", "S. Lewis", "M. Salih", "J. Helmer", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "J. Morgan", "S. Lehman", "A. Hopkins", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Turner", "E. Peloza", "and S. Hillier"], "also_present": ["J. Adema", "B. Card", "I. Collins", "B. Coxhead", "S. Datars Bere", "J. Fleming", "C. Green", "S. King", "G. Kotsifas", "L. Livingstone", "D. MacRae", "K. Murray", "J. McGonigle", "B. O'Hagen", "M. Ribera", "C. Saunders", "M. Schulthess", "C. Smith", "J. Stanford", "S. Stafford", "J. Taylor", "R. Wilcox."], "remote_attendance": ["The meeting was called to order at 4:04 PM with all Members present", "except  A. Kayabaga."], "content": {"__class__": "Content"}, "absent": ["A. Kayabaga"], "items": {"1": {"title": "Disclosures of Pecuniary Interest", "number": "1", "content": [{"string": "That it BE NOTED that the following pecuniary interests were disclosed:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "a) \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Councillor S. Turner discloses a pecuniary interest in Strategy SOC-12 and SOC-13, having to do with licensed child care and early years opportunities, by indicating that his wife is an employee of an EarlyON centre;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b) \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Councillor P. Van Meerbergen discloses a pecuniary interest in Strategy SOC-12 and SOC-13, having to do with licensed child care and early years opportunities, by indicating that his wife operates a daycare; and,", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "c) \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Councillor S. Lehman discloses a pecuniary interest in Strategy GOE-21, having to do with London's downtown, by indicating that he is a member of the London Downtown Business Association.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2019-04-01 16:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "2": {"title": "Consent", "number": "2", "content": [{"string": "None.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2019-04-01 16:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "3": {"title": "Scheduled Items", "number": "3", "content": [], "items": {"1": {"title": "Council's Strategic Plan 2019-2023: Draft Outcomes, Expected Results, Strategies, Metrics, Targets and Preliminary Cost Estimates", "number": "1", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the following actions be taken with respect to the Council\u2019s Strategic Plan 2019-2023:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "a)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the staff report dated April 1, 2019 entitled: \"Council\u2019s Strategic Plan 2019-2023:\u00a0 Draft Outcomes, Expected Results, Strategies, Metrics, Targets and Preliminary Costs Estimates\u201d, BE RECEIVED;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the communication from Anova and London Abuses Women\u2019s Centre entitled \u201cStrategic Area of Focus:\u00a0 Creating a Safe London for Woman and Girls\u201d, BE RECEIVED;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "c)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the attached (Appendix \u201cA\u201d) revised \u201cDraft Outcomes, Expected Results, Strategies and Metrics\u201d BE APPROVED, with the exception of BSC-20, SOC-12, SOC-13, and GOE-21, and forwarded to the April 8, 2019 Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee meeting for further discussion;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "d)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the revised \u201cDraft Outcomes, Expected Results, Strategies and Metrics\u201d BE APPROVED, as related to SOC-12 and SOC-13, and forwarded to the April 8, 2019 Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee meeting for further discussion;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "e)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 the revised \u201cDraft Outcomes, Expected Results, Strategies and Metrics\u201d BE APPROVED, as related to GOE-21, and forwarded to the April 8, 2019 Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee meeting for further discussion; and", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "f) \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 that BSC-20 BE REFERRED to the April 8, 2019 Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee meeting for discussion;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "it being noted that the attached (Appendix \u201dB\u201d) presentation from the Managing Director, Neighbourhood, Children & Fire Services was received.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [{"string": "Voting Record:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by M. Cassidy", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by E. Peloza", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Motion to approve Parts (a), (b), (c), and (f).", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["Mayor E. Holder", "M. van Holst", "S. Lewis", "J. Helmer", "M. Cassidy", "P. Squire", "J. Morgan", "S. Lehman", "A. Hopkins", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Turner", "E. Peloza,S. Hillier"]}, {"vote": "Absent:", "voters": ["M. Salih,A. Kayabaga"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (13 to 0)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"